# trailing_widgets

Small Flutter extensions for padding, expanded widgets, and row/column layouts.

## Installation

```yaml
dependencies:
  trailing_widgets:
    git:
      url: https://github.com/FabrizioG202/dart_packages
      path: trailing_widgets
```

## Usage

```dart
import 'package:flutter/widgets.dart';
import 'package:trailing_widgets/trailing_widgets.dart';

final padded = const Text('Hello').padAll(16);
final layout = [
  const Text('First').expanded(),
  const Text('Second'),
].row(spacing: 8);
```
